----                             3767  ; The emit* helpers encode the same little-endian jump-target format produced by  ; [section data]
----                             3768  ; Rust's default_family_tokenizer_vm_program_bytes(). Keep demoProgram and the  ; [section data]
----                             3769  ; DEMO_PC_* offsets together so the control-flow map stays readable.  ; [section data]
----                             3770    ; [section data]
